'''Swords''' are a type of melee [[weapon]] that comes in three [[item class]]es: [[List of one hand swords|One-Handed Swords]], [[List of thrusting one hand swords|Thrusting One-Handed Swords]], and [[List of two hand swords|Two-Handed Swords]].

One-Handed Swords and Two-Handed Swords require [[strength]] and [[dexterity]] to equip, and provide increased {{c|mod|x% increased Global [[Accuracy|Accuracy Rating]]}} or {{c|mod|+X to [[Accuracy|Accuracy Rating]]}} as an [[implicit]] [[modifier]].

Thrusting One-Handed Swords require [[dexterity]], and provide {{c|mod|+x% to Global [[Critical Strike Multiplier]]}} as an implicit modifier.

Local modifiers only affect the item they appear on, for instance, Local Accuracy will only affect the sword it is on. It won't affect the damage on an off-hand weapon when [[Dual Wielding|dual-wielding]], and won't increase physical damage granted from other items like rings. Global modifiers increase your stats across the board, unlike Local modifiers.

Different item classes may have different [[corrupt]]ed modifiers.

